<title>JAPAN: Nippon Oil 6-mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nippon Oil 6-mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		867.70		vs	  795.72</p>
<p> Operating   loss 194    million    vs	prft 213 million</p>
<p> Current	    946    million    vs	    7.19</p>
<p> Net		    1.11		vs	    6.01</p>
<p> EPS		    0.90 yen	  vs	    4.89 yen</p>
<p> Shares	   1.23 billion	  vs	1.23 billion</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nippon Oil Co Ltd is a major distributor of petroleum products.</p>
</text>
